OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FRather cloudy this morning with
OL,6,Fa chance of some patchy rain, most
OL,7,Flikely in the north and west. Rain
OL,8,Fclearing by late morning bringing
OL,9,Fwidespread very warm sunshine to the
OL,10,Fregion and an increasingly humid feel.
OL,11,FWinds light or moderate.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FLargely fine and dry this
OL,14,Fevening and overnight, however a few
OL,15,Fisolated spots of rain are possible,
OL,16,Fmainly before midnight. A muggy night
OL,17,Fto come for most.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
