OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CMonday:FA widely dry and bright start.
OL,6,FProbably cloudier with an increased
OL,7,Fchance of showers from late-morning to
OL,8,Flate-afternoon but still very warm.
OL,9,FRain spreading eastwards overnight
OL,10,Finto Tuesday.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FRain
OL,13,Fclearing Tuesday with fresher,
OL,14,Fbrighter conditions developing.
OL,15,FWednesday, mainly dry and bright then
OL,16,Fpotentially turning wet and rather
OL,17,Fbreezy on Thursday. Temperatures
OL,18,Faround average for early September.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
